sequenceDiagram
    actor UA as User A (sharer)
    participant A as QuickR (send)
    participant S as STUN server
    participant B as QuickR (receive)
    actor UB as User B (viewer)

    A->>S: Binding request
    S-->>A: Public IP:port of A
    B->>S: Binding request
    S-->>B: Public IP:port of B
    A->>UA: Show room code (e.g. BA9B1283:c1a6)
    B->>UB: Show room code
    UA-->>UB: Exchange codes (chat, call…)
    UA->>A: Enter B's code
    UB->>B: Enter A's code

    loop every 400 ms, up to 19 tries
        A->>B: Sync
        B->>A: Sync
    end
    Note over A,B: First Sync received → 5 more Sync at 100 ms intervals, NAT mappings open

    A->>B: Video + audio datagrams
    B-->>A: IDR request (when loss is detected)
    A-->>B: IDR ack
